%% Enterprise UI Playground - opening a subflow in the device frame
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Visitor
    participant R as GoRouter
    participant E as SubflowEditorPage
    participant D as flows_data (kAllFlows)
    participant F as DeviceFramePreview
    participant S as Subflow screen (lib/flows/**)

    U->>R: navigate /flows/account-management/logging-in
    R->>D: flowBySlug + subFlowBySlug
    D-->>R: Flow + SubFlow(status, screenBuilder)
    R->>E: build with flow + subflow params
    E->>E: render SubflowListPanel (20% width, active = logging-in)
    alt status == built
        E->>F: DeviceFramePreview(child: screenBuilder(context))
        F->>F: MediaQuery override (390x844, dpr, safe areas, textScaler 1.0)
        F->>F: clean Theme + nested Navigator (GlobalKey)
        F->>S: mount screen
        S-->>U: live UI inside phone frame
        U->>S: tap -> Navigator.push / showModalBottomSheet
        S->>S: navigation stays inside frame
    else status == comingSoon
        E->>F: DeviceFramePreview(child: ComingSoonScreen(...))
        F-->>U: "Coming soon" + flow / subflow name
    end
    U->>E: tap another list item
    E->>R: context.go(.../switching-account)
    R->>E: rebuild, frame swaps child, URL + back-button updated
